  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed 2-storey side extension due to its proximity to the side boundary to the adjoining property No. 23 Wynchgate would lead to the creation of a terracing effect, detrimental to the character of the street scene through a closing of the separation between the properties.  This would be contrary to DMD14 and DMD37 and Local Plan Policy CP30.",
    "The proposed two storey side and rear extension with pitched gable end roof over, together with rear dormer by reason of its size, siting and design would appear bulky and incongruous, and would represent an overly dominant, incongruous and visually intrusive form of development out of keeping and character with, and detrimental to the appearance and character of the application property and pattern of development contrary to Local Plan Policy CP30 and Development Management Document DMD13, DMD14 and DMD 37.",
    "The proposed two storey side and rear extension by reason of its size, siting and depth would have an overbearing effect upon the adjoining properties Nos. 23 and 27 Wynchgate that would result in a loss of light and outlook, detrimental to the amenities of those adjoining neighbouring occupiers, contrary to Local Plan Policy CP30 Development Management Document Policies DMD8 and DMD11 and DMD37. \r\r"
  ],
